    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/air-and-water/water#BioticIndexObservation.bioticIndex> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/air-and-water/water>;
